WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.382
The paper makes three contributions.

00:00:02.462 --> 00:00:05.186
It defines goal-conditioned bisimulation,

00:00:05.266 --> 00:00:08.673
grouping state-goal pairs that behave equivalently.

00:00:08.753 --> 00:00:14.076
It gives a metric-learning objective so new goals
arise from latent arithmetic.

00:00:14.156 --> 00:00:19.410
And it proves the representation is sufficient for
any state-only reward task.
